# Line endings are a correctness issue in this repo, not a style preference.
#
# The code lock records md5 of the *blob* bytes (LF). A Windows working tree with
# core.autocrlf=true produces CRLF, and the git-less GPU host receives whatever
# was copied. On 2026-11-12 that made `code_lock --check` pass while run_hc's own
# startup guard refused the same files, because the two hashed different bytes.
#
# `run_hc.md5` now normalises CRLF->LF, so the two paths agree by construction.
# This file keeps the bytes identical in the first place.
* text=auto
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.csv text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
